              "source_note": "套图：23 张；每张图的正向提示词随当前图切换，负面词与角色词展示取封面。\n参数：Steps: 28, Sampler: Euler A, CFG scale: 6.0, CFG rescale: 0.5, Seed: 1777082234, Size: 832x1216, Noise schedule: karras\n元数据：NovelAI-Stealth",
