                  "rawTag": "nsfw, 2::1girl::, 2::1boy::, 0.6::artist:nyong nyong ::, 0.8::artist:hiro (dismaless) ::, 0.5::artist:morino hon ::, 0.4::artist:kingin ::, 0.6::artist:ebora ::, 0.6::artist:ramanda ::, 0.7::artist:modare ::, -1::artist collaboration ::, very aesthetic, amazing quality, ultra complexity, thick outlines, -3::monochrome ::, -1::limited palette ::, -1::flat color ::, -1::pale colors ::, -1::muted colors ::, outdoors, night, alley, bullet streak, dark alley\nA dark urban alleyway illuminated by the sudden glow of a pink energy blade and gunfire flashes. A dynamic manga page split diagonally across three panels, leading the eye rapidly from a sudden muzzle flash, to a frantic grab pulling the protagonist behind, and resolving into the ignition of a glowing beam saber. A tight reaction shot of the heroine shouting a warning as a bullet streaks past. The heroine forcefully dragging the protagonist behind her back to protect him. A dramatic low-angle shot of the heroine igniting a vibrant pink energy sword."
                },
                {
                  "path": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-02.jpg",
                  "original": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-02.webp",
                  "rawTag": "nsfw, 2::2girls::, 0.6::artist:nyong nyong ::, 0.8::artist:hiro (dismaless) ::, 0.5::artist:morino hon ::, 0.4::artist:kingin ::, 0.6::artist:ebora ::, 0.6::artist:ramanda ::, 0.7::artist:modare ::, -1::artist collaboration ::, very aesthetic, amazing quality, ultra complexity, thick outlines, -3::monochrome ::, -1::limited palette ::, -1::flat color ::, -1::pale colors ::, -1::muted colors ::, outdoors, night, rooftop ledge, bullet sparks, night sky\nA high-contrast night scene contrasting a rooftop ledge against the dark alley ground below. A dramatic vertical two-panel manga layout emphasizing extreme vertical distance: a top panel showing the sniper overlooking the city edge, and a dominant bottom panel showing the heroine standing guard below with sword drawn. A mysterious combatant standing stoically at the rooftop edge holding a battle rifle, visor glowing pink. The heroine standing firm in the alley below, energy blade raised as deflected bullet sparks rain down."
                },
                {
                  "path": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-03.jpg",
                  "original": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-03.webp",
                  "rawTag": "nsfw, 2::1girl::, 0.6::artist:nyong nyong ::, 0.8::artist:hiro (dismaless) ::, 0.5::artist:morino hon ::, 0.4::artist:kingin ::, 0.6::artist:ebora ::, 0.6::artist:ramanda ::, 0.7::artist:modare ::, -1::artist collaboration ::, very aesthetic, amazing quality, ultra complexity, thick outlines, -3::monochrome ::, -1::limited palette ::, -1::flat color ::, -1::pale colors ::, -1::muted colors ::, outdoors, night, rooftop, city night skyline, urban alley\nHigh building rooftop overlooking the dark alley below under the night sky. A high-tension manga page where a wide upper panel captures the dark rooftop perch, followed by a tight diagonal panel focusing on the rifle bolt action, leading down to a dominant lower panel showing the muzzle flash firing into the alley below. Medium view looking up at the combatant woman standing atop the dark rooftop railing aiming her battle rifle downward. Tight close-up of gloved hands pulling back the rifle charging handle with mechanical precision. Dominant high-angle shot as the battle rifle unleashes fiery muzzle bursts down toward the alleyway with sharp muzzle flash and flying casing smoke."
                },
                {
                  "path": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-04.jpg",
                  "original": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-04.webp",
                  "rawTag": "nsfw, 2::2girls::, 0.6::artist:nyong nyong ::, 0.8::artist:hiro (dismaless) ::, 0.5::artist:morino hon ::, 0.4::artist:kingin ::, 0.6::artist:ebora ::, 0.6::artist:ramanda ::, 0.7::artist:modare ::, -1::artist collaboration ::, very aesthetic, amazing quality, ultra complexity, thick outlines, -3::monochrome ::, -1::limited palette ::, -1::flat color ::, -1::pale colors ::, -1::muted colors ::, outdoors, night, muzzle flash, pink light trails, night sky\nAn open night sky between alley buildings streaked with rapid rifle gunfire and bright pink light trails. A dynamic manga page built on powerful vertical flow: an upper wide panel of the sniper firing rapid bursts downward, and a dominant bottom vertical panel capturing the heroine vaulting into the air leaving bright pink afterimages. The visor-wearing sniper rapidly firing her battle rifle down from the rooftop ledge amidst bright muzzle flashes. The heroine leaping high into the air with glowing pink trails tracing her powerful upward leap."
                },
                {
                  "path": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-05.jpg",
                  "original": "nai5_community_pack_suozhang_set_0074-05.webp",
                  "rawTag": "nsfw, 2::1girl::, 0.6::artist:nyong nyong ::, 0.8::artist:hiro (dismaless) ::, 0.5::artist:morino hon ::, 0.4::artist:kingin ::, 0.6::artist:ebora ::, 0.6::artist:ramanda ::, 0.7::artist:modare ::, -1::artist collaboration ::, very aesthetic, amazing quality, ultra complexity, thick outlines, -3::monochrome ::, -1::limited palette ::, -1::flat color ::, -1::pale colors ::, -1::muted colors ::, outdoors, night, alley, concrete wall, motion blur\nA narrow dark urban alley between tall concrete buildings at night, filled with streaks of bright pink energy trails. A dynamic multi-panel action page leading from a ground-level initial jump to a high-angle upward surge between concrete walls. Low-angle dynamic shot showing the initial powerful kick off the alley concrete wall, generating a bright burst of pink energy sparks. Dominant vertical frame showing rapid zig-zag rebounds between narrow alley walls with glowing light trails stretching upward toward the rooftop. Visual momentum carries the dynamic leap upward across the panel boundary toward the dark night sky."
